```text
The MPI test framework supports multi-process and multi-node test execution.
Hostfiles and MPI implementation-specific interface arguments are supplied by
the runner. RCCL's network interface can be pinned with ``NCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME``.
The framework distinguishes node-local P2P/SHM tests from multi-node NET and
distributed-collective tests.
```
